WEBVTT

00:16:55.996 --> 00:17:00.162
having to to take off the mask and
show what they're really feeling.

00:17:00.162 --> 00:17:04.579
And so is is there something also built
into their work in addition to

00:17:04.579 --> 00:17:06.454
the fact that you get to
prove your strength,

00:17:06.954 --> 00:17:09.621
that you can't you can't hide from
the emotions altogether?

00:17:10.746 --> 00:17:13.621
Yeah, I think the thing that
I would ask I would ask

00:17:13.621 --> 00:17:16.621
the great contributions that they made
without taking off the mask,

00:17:16.663 --> 00:17:18.746
how much greater could they have been?

00:17:19.996 --> 00:17:24.079
What changes could they have made had they
had that combination of intellect

00:17:24.829 --> 00:17:33.163
plus humanity and, you know, reading
think again was a catalyst for me,